    "Name": "Hyaenodont A",
    "Details": "The Hyaenodont A configuration mounts a Thumper Artillery and two Mech-Scale Grenade Launchers for indirect fire and area suppression. Its energy complement includes two Improved Large Pulse Lasers, lightweight yet powerful early Clan designs, alongside one Improved Large Laser and two Compact PPCs for focused, high-energy strikes. With the PHI Suite, it shares targeting data across the lance to improve coordination. This versatile loadout combines heavy indirect bombardment with strong direct-energy attacks, allowing the Hyaenodont A to suppress enemy formations and adapt on the battlefield.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Long +</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.28</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_Hyaenodont"
  },
